{"id":"961e3f5fd41019e9","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-thm-banach-steinhaus.md","title":"Banach–Steinhaus Theorem","display":"thm-banach-steinhaus — Banach–Steinhaus Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-banach-steinhaus","aliases":["58-thm-banach-steinhaus"],"display":"thm-banach-steinhaus — Banach–Steinhaus Theorem","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","[[58-df-linear-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-banach-steinhaus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-banach-steinhaus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-banach-steinhaus — Banach–Steinhaus Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ef59807ad934771f\" href=\"?note=ef59807ad934771f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bdbbe5a00af04978\" href=\"?note=bdbbe5a00af04978\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md\">../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9fa59a08139e4466\" href=\"?note=9fa59a08139e4466\" title=\"58-df-linear-operator\">58-df-linear-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,\\mathcal T,T,x,M_x,M\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,\\mathcal T,T,x,M_x,M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Banach}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Banach}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S\\)</span> (space predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\)</span> (bounded-linear-map predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\">\\(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\)</span> (operator norm on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L(X,Y)\">\\(\\mathcal L(X,Y)\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}steinhaus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,\\mathbb K,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\n\\land\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{T\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M_x)\n\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\leq M).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}steinhaus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,\\mathbb K,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\n\\land\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{T\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M_x)\n\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\leq M).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The domain and codomain structures now expose their common scalar field and their respective operations and norms; boundedness is not inferred from unrelated unary space structures.</li>\n<li>Completeness is required for the domain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>; the codomain <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y\">\\(Y\\)</span> need only be normed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"ef59807ad934771f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-banach-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"bdbbe5a00af04978","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-normed-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-linear-operator","status":"resolved","id":"9fa59a08139e4466","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-linear-operator]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y,\\mathcal T,T,x,M_x,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Banach}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L(X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}banach\\text{-}steinhaus}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Banach}_S(X,\\mathbb K,+_X,\\cdot_X,\\|\\cdot\\|_X)\\land\\mathrm{NormedSpace}_S(Y,\\mathbb K,+_Y,\\cdot_Y,\\|\\cdot\\|_Y)\n\\land\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\{T\\in Y^X\\mid\\mathrm{BoundedLinear}_{\\mathbb K}(T;X,Y)\\}\n\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;\\exists M_x\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T(x)\\|_Y\\leq M_x)\n\\to\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall T\\in\\mathcal T\\;(\\|T\\|_{\\mathrm{op}}\\leq M).","display":true},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"Y","display":false}],"bytes":1452,"back